@startuml SafeRoute_Systemgraense
scale 1.4
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 90
skinparam ArrowColor #666666
skinparam ArrowFontColor #444444
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam rectangleBorderThickness 0

skinparam folder {
  BackgroundColor #EDEDED
  BorderColor #7F8C8D
  FontStyle bold
  FontSize 15
}

skinparam rectangle<<person>> {
  BackgroundColor #08427B
  FontColor white
  FontSize 15
  RoundCorner 20
}
skinparam rectangle<<system>> {
  BackgroundColor #1168BD
  FontColor white
  FontStyle bold
  FontSize 16
  RoundCorner 20
}
skinparam rectangle<<external>> {
  BackgroundColor #8C8C8C
  FontColor white
  FontSize 14
  RoundCorner 20
}

title System Context Diagram: SafeRoute (arkitekturperspektiv)

rectangle "**Bruger**\n(fodgænger)\n\nTilgår systemet via\nmobilklienten" <<person>> as Bruger

folder "SW System" as SWSystem {
  rectangle "**Mobile Client**\n[React Native / Expo]\n\nKort, rutevalg,\nindrapportering,\nlokal geofence-evaluering" <<system>> as Mobile
  rectangle "**Backend API**\n[FastAPI]\n\nRuter, zoner, scorer,\nrapporter, auth" <<system>> as Backend
}

folder "External Boundaries" as ExternalBoundaries {
  rectangle "**OSRM**\n[Rutemotor]\n\nBeregner kandidat-ruter\n(tid, geometri) for gang" <<external>> as OSRM
  rectangle "**Danmarks Statistik m.fl.**\n[Offentlig datakilde]\n\nKommunale kriminalitets-\nog belysningsdata" <<external>> as OpenData
  rectangle "**Nyhedskilder**\n[Ekstern datakilde]\n\nRSS/API med\nkriminalitetsrelaterede\nnyheder" <<external>> as News
  rectangle "**OS-notifikationstjeneste**\n[Ekstern tjeneste]\n\nExpo/Apple/Google:\nleverer/viser push- og\nlokale notifikationer" <<external>> as Push
}

Bruger -down-> Mobile : Søger ruter,\nindrapporterer,\ndeler live-position
Mobile -up-> Bruger : Ruteforslag, score,\nforklaring, advarsler

Mobile -right-> Backend : REST/WebSocket

Backend -down-> OSRM : Forespørger\nkandidat-ruter (REST)
Backend -down-> OpenData : Henter periodisk\n(REST/pull)
Backend -down-> News : Henter periodisk\n(REST/pull)

Mobile -[#8C8C8C]down-> Push : Planlægger/viser\nnotifikation lokalt
Push -[#8C8C8C]up-> Bruger : Viser notifikation\npå telefonen

note bottom of Mobile
  Mobile Client indgår i systemgrænsen (SW System):
  geofence-tjek mod cachede zone-polygoner
  køres lokalt på telefonen (se afsnit 4.3),
  ikke som et separat eksternt system
end note

@enduml
